Error [E0052]: test blocks are written with `#Test`, not bare `test`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_test_keyword.jet:5:1
    |
  5 | test "double works" {
    | ^^^^
 Why: `#Test` is a marker, like every other `#`-tag, so a test declaration draws the eye
 Fix: write: #Test ("name") { ... }

Error [E0052]: test name must be parenthesized: `#Test("name")`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_test_keyword.jet:5:6
    |
  5 | test "double works" {
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: the name is now an argument to the marker, not a bare adjacent string
 Fix: write: #Test ("describes this block") { ... }
